+# Update 7.0.68
+
+Selected language editions now render as finished videos. Each additional English, Hindi or Odia edition uses the approved picture, its own reviewed narration, timed cards, captions and its chosen channel profile. A missing or voiceless edition is refused instead of exported with English audio. See [the 7.0.68 render guide](LANGUAGE_EDITIONS_RENDER_V7_0_68.md).
+
 # Update 7.0.67
 
 Guided Studio now separates the master script from its output language editions. Choose the master/primary language and any additional English, Hindi or Odia editions before drafting. Gemini drafts one story, selected editions are localized for review, and the exact approved scripts are used to prepare every TTS track before any timed-card request. See [the language-edition guide](LANGUAGE_EDITIONS_V7_0_67.md).
